            <ArticleTitle>Neurologic Complications in Managing Degenerative Cervical Myelopathy: Pathogenesis, Prevention, and Management.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>129-137</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
